The full text of the Apache 2.0 License is available in the [LICENSE-CORE](LICENSE-CORE) file.

## Professional and Enterprise Editions

The CAM Protocol Professional and Enterprise Editions are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 
with the Commons Clause restriction. This means that while the code is open source, you cannot sell the 
software or a hosted/managed service that provides the software's primary functionality without a 
commercial license from the CAM Protocol team.

The full text of the Commons Clause License is available in the [LICENSE-ENTERPRISE](LICENSE-ENTERPRISE) file.

For commercial licensing inquiries, please contact: [edwardstechpros+cam@outlook.com](mailto:edwardstechpros+cam@outlook.com)
